{"id": "t091-054", "text": "Kenji got the Rolls-Royce job! Starts 7/1. Celebratory dinner Sat, I'm booking somewhere. His girlfriend Mei is coming and his parents are driving down from Leeds, so table for six. He's a massive whisky nerd, a decent bottle of Yamazaki would be the gift. Need to check if Tadhg can make it too", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Rolls-Royce job", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7/1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Celebratory dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down from Leeds", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "whisky", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "decent bottle of Yamazaki would be the gift", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check if Tadhg can make it too", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t091-056", "text": "No shop this week, freezer's full. Gym Mon/Wed/Fri.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Mon/Wed/Fri", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t091-057", "text": "Luis and his wife Marta have been trying for a baby for two years, starting IVF on the 3rd of March. He told me in confidence. Ask how he's doing in a couple of weeks", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marta", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying for a baby", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "two years"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "IVF", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd of March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask how he's doing", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a couple of weeks", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t091-059", "text": "Chat with Alejandro after footie. Wife Elena got the head teacher job she interviewed for in March. Starts after Easter. Their son Diego has his GCSEs from May 12th, revising v hard", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after footie"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elena", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head teacher job", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interviewed", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Easter", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Diego", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSEs", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "from May 12th", "anchor": "e4"}]}
